<p class="small">✚ = needs it · ◑ = partly there · — = n/a. (Omen hdr = rotating tap-to-reveal §10 header · Voice = soulful-voice copy pass · Quick-pop = §6.7.6 quick-action popups · Flora = 60+-library signature species + lifecycle · Feature = an in-flight feature lands here, see §6.)</p>
